<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>ClinCard Quick Reference Guide</title>
    <style>
        @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
        .page {
            width: 794px; height: 1123px;
            padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
            overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
            position: relative;
            font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
        }
        .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
        h1, h2, h3 { font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif; }
        .logo-container { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 40px; }
        .logo-greenphire { font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; }
        .clincard-logo { font-size: 48px; font-weight: bold; }
        .powered-by { font-size: 16px; color: #555; }
        .divider { border-top: 1px solid #ccc; margin: 20px 0; }
        .toc-list { list-style: none; padding-left: 0; }
        .toc-list li { margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .toc-list a { text-decoration: none; color: #333; }
        .section-header { font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .step-list { margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .step-list li { margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.5; }
        .code-block { background-color: #f4f4f4; padding: 15px; border-radius: 5px; margin-bottom: 20px; font-family: "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans", monospace; }
        .table-container { margin-top: 20px; }
        table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 15px; }
        th, td { border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px; text-align: left; }
        th { background-color: #f2f2f2; }
        .form-group { margin-bottom: 15px; }
        .form-group label { display: block; margin-bottom: 5px; font-weight: bold; }
        .form-group input[type="text"], .form-group input[type="password"], .form-group select { width: 100%; padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ccc; box-sizing: border-box; }
        .button-group button { padding: 10px 20px; margin-right: 10px; cursor: pointer; }
        .footer { position: absolute; bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0; padding: 20px 60px; font-size: 12px; color: #777; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
    <div class="logo-container">
        <div class="logo-greenphire">greenphire</div>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 100px;">
        <div class="clincard-logo">ClinCard</div>
        <div class="powered-by">Powered by <span class="logo-greenphire">greenphire</span></div>
        <h1 style="margin-top: 30px;">ClinCard Quick Reference Guide</h1>
        <div class="divider"></div>
        <p>Version {{ version }}</p>
        <p>Updated: {{ last_updated }}</p>
    </div>

    <h2 style="margin-top: 50px;">Table of Contents</h2>
    <ul class="toc-list">
        <li><a href="#login">Login to ClinCard</a></li>
        <li><a href="#register">Register a Subject</a></li>
        <li><a href="#subject-info">Subject Information</a></li>
        <li><a href="#lookup">Look Up a Previously Registered Subject</a></li>
        <li><a href="#assign">Assign a ClinCard</a></li>
        <li><a href="#add-study">Add a New Study to an Existing Subject</a></li>
        <li><a href="#request-assistance">Request Assistance</a></li>
    </ul>

    <div class="footer">
        <span>&copy; {{ current_year }} greenphire</span>
        <span>1</span>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <div class="logo-container">
        <div class="clincard-logo">ClinCard</div>
        <div class="powered-by">Powered by <span class="logo-greenphire">greenphire</span></div>
    </div>

    <h2 id="login" class="section-header">Login to ClinCard</h2>
    <div class="step-list">
        <li>Login to <a href="{{ login_url }}">www.clincard.com</a>.</li>
        <li>Enter your username and password. *Your login credentials are case sensitive.</li>
    </div>

    <div class="code-block">
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 30px;">
            <div style="width: 300px;">
                <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 10px;">
                    <div style="font-size: 30px;">ClinCard</div>
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="username">Username*</label>
                    <input type="text" id="username" value="{{ username_placeholder }}">
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="password">Password*</label>
                    <input type="password" id="password" value="{{ password_placeholder }}">
                </div>
                <div class="button-group" style="text-align: center; margin-top: 20px;">
                    <button style="background-color: #4CAF50; color: white;">LOGIN</button>
                    <label style="margin-left: 15px;"><input type="checkbox"> Remember Username</label>
                </div>
                <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 15px;">
                    <a href="{{ forgot_password_link }}">Forgot your username/password?</a>
                    <a href="{{ cardholder_help_link }}">Cardholder? Click Here</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="step-list">
        <li>If you have difficulty logging in, click <a href="{{ forgot_password_link }}">Forgot your username/password?</a>. Enter your email address and click <a href="{{ recover_link }}">Recover</a>.</li>
        <ul style="list-style-type: disc; margin-left: 20px;">
            <li>This will instantly send you an email with a link that allows you to reset your password.</li>
            <li>You can also call our site support team:
                <ul style="list-style-type: disc; margin-left: 20px;">
                    <li>Local United States/Canada: {{ local_phone }}</li>
                    <li>United States Toll Free Number: {{ toll_free_phone }}</li>
                </ul>
            </li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="code-block">
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 30px;">
            <div style="width: 300px;">
                <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 10px;">
                    <div style="font-size: 30px;">ClinCard</div>
                </div>
                <div style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 20px;">
                    <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 15px;">Password Recovery</div>
                    <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 12px;">To begin the process of recovering your password, please enter your email below.</div>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="email">Email*</label>
                        <input type="text" id="email" value="{{ email_placeholder }}">
                    </div>
                    <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 20px;">
                        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
                            <input type="checkbox" id="captcha_check">
                            <label for="captcha_check">Protected by reCAPTCHA</label>
                        </div>
                        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 10px;">
                            <button style="background-color: #4CAF50; color: white;">RECOVER</button>
                            <button style="background-color: #ccc;">CANCEL</button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
        <span>&copy; {{ current_year }} greenphire</span>
        <span>2</span>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <div class="logo-container">
        <div class="clincard-logo">ClinCard</div>
        <div class="powered-by">Powered by <span class="logo-greenphire">greenphire</span></div>
    </div>

    <h2 id="register" class="section-header">Register a Subject</h2>
    <div class="step-list">
        <li>Login to <a href="{{ login_url }}">www.clincard.com</a>.</li>
        <li>Click the <span data-field="register_subject_tab">{{ register_subject_tab }}</span> tab.</li>
        <li>Select the appropriate Study from the drop-down menu.</li>
        <li>Enter the information into the form. Fields denoted with a red asterisk (*) are required.</li>
    </div>

    <div class="code-block">
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 30px;">
            <div style="width: 600px;">
                <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 10px;">
                    <div style="font-size: 30px;">Subject Registration</div>
                </div>
                <div style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 20px;">
                    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 20px;">
                        <button style="background-color: #ddd;">Study Status</button>
                        <button style="background-color: #ddd;">Subject ID*</button>
                        <button style="background-color: #ddd;">Study*</button>
                    </div>

                    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 20px;">
                        <div>
                            <div class="form-group">
                                <label for="first_name">Name</label>
                                <input type="text" id="first_name" value="{{ first_name_placeholder }}">
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-group">
                                <label for="middle_name">Middle</label>
                                <input type="text" id="middle_name" value="{{ middle_name_placeholder }}">
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-group">
                                <label for="last_name">Last Name*</label>
                                <input type="text" id="last_name" value="{{ last_name_placeholder }}">
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-group">
                                <label for="ssn">Social Security Number</label>
                                <input type="text" id="ssn" value="{{ ssn_placeholder }}">
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <div class="form-group">
                                <label for="country">Address</label>
                                <select id="country">
                                    <option value="{{ country_option_1 }}">{{ country_option_1_name }}</option>
                                    <option value="{{ country_option_2 }}">{{ country_option_2_name }}</option>
                                </select>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-group">
                                <label for="city">City</label>
                                <input type="text" id="city" value="{{ city_placeholder }}">
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-group">
                                <label for="zip">Zip</label>
                                <input type="text" id="zip" value="{{ zip_placeholder }}">
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-group">
                                <label for="phone">Phone</label>
                                <input type="text" id="phone" value="{{ phone_placeholder }}">
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div style="margin-top: 30px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 20px;">
                        <div>
                            <div class="form-group">
                                <label for="time_zone">Timezone*</label>
                                <select id="time_zone">
                                    <option value="{{ tz_option_1 }}">{{ tz_option_1_name }}</option>
                                    <option value="{{ tz_option_2 }}">{{ tz_option_2_name }}</option>
                                </select>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-group">
                                <label for="language">Language</label>
                                <select id="language">
                                    <option value="{{ lang_option_1 }}">{{ lang_option_1_name }}</option>
                                    <option value="{{ lang_option_2 }}">{{ lang_option_2_name }}</option>
                                </select>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <div class="form-group">
                                <label for="email">Email*</label>
                                <input type="text" id="email" value="{{ email_placeholder }}">
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-group">
                                <label for="subject_email">Subject Email Address</label>
                                <input type="text" id="subject_email" value="{{ subject_email_placeholder }}">
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-group">
                                <label for="sms_opt_in">SMS Opt In</label>
                                <input type="checkbox" id="sms_opt_in">
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-group">
                                <label for="text_messaging_opt_in">Enable Text Messaging</label>
                                <input type="checkbox" id="text_messaging_opt_in">
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="button-group" style="text-align: center; margin-top: 30px;">
                        <button style="background-color: #4CAF50; color: white;">REGISTER</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="step-list" style="margin-top: 30px;">
        <li>If you would like the Subject to receive payment confirmations or appointment reminders, select the "Enable Email Alerts" and "Enable Text Messaging" checkboxes.</li>
        <li>Click <span data-field="register_button">{{ register_button }}</span>.</li>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
        <span>&copy; {{ current_year }} greenphire</span>
        <span>2</span>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <div class="logo-container">
        <div class="clincard-logo">ClinCard</div>
        <div class="powered-by">Powered by <span class="logo-greenphire">greenphire</span></div>
    </div>

    <h2 id="subject-info" class="section-header">Subject Information</h2>
    <p>You will be brought to the "Subject Information" screen where you can assign a card number, make a payment, schedule an appointment reminder, replace a ClinCard or edit a Subject's information.</p>

    <div class="code-block">
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 30px;">
            <div style="width: 700px;">
                <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 10px;">
                    <button style="background-color: #ddd;">SUBJECT INFORMATION</button>
                    <button style="background-color: #ddd;">AUDIT HISTORY</button>
                </div>
                <div style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 20px;">
                    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 30px;">
                        <div>
                            <div class="form-group">
                                <label>Study Name</label>
                                <span data-field="study_name">{{ study_name_placeholder }}</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-group">
                                <label>Subject ID</label>
                                <span data-field="subject_id">{{ subject_id_placeholder }}</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-group">
                                <label>No card assigned.</label>
                                <span data-field="no_card_assigned_status">{{ no_card_assigned_status }}</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <div class="form-group">
                                <label>Study Status</label>
                                <span data-field="study_status">{{ study_status_placeholder }}</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-group">
                                <label>Address</label>
                                <span data-field="address_placeholder">{{ address_placeholder }}</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-group">
                                <label>Timezone</label>
                                <span data-field="timezone_placeholder">{{ timezone_placeholder }}</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-group">
                                <label>Phone</label>
                                <span data-field="phone_placeholder">{{ phone_placeholder }}</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-group">
                                <label>Allow Text Messages</label>
                                <span data-field="allow_sms_placeholder">{{ allow_sms_placeholder }}</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-group">
                                <label>Allow Email</label>
                                <span data-field="allow_email_placeholder">{{ allow_email_placeholder }}</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-around; margin-top: 40px; border-top: 1px solid #eee; padding-top: 20px;">
                        <div style="text-align: center;">
                            <button style="background-color: #ffc107; color: black; padding: 10px 15px; border: none; cursor: pointer;">ASSIGN CLINCARD</button>
                            <p style="font-size: 12px; margin-top: 5px;">REQUEST PAYMENT</p>
                            <p style="font-size: 12px;">REQUEST REIMBURSEMENT</p>
                            <p style="font-size: 12px;">SCHEDULE APPOINTMENT</p>
                        </div>
                        <div style="text-align: center;">
                            <button style="background-color: #ffc107; color: black; padding: 10px 15px; border: none; cursor: pointer;">EDIT SUBJECT</button>
                            <p style="font-size: 12px; margin-top: 5px;">VIEW HISTORY</p>
                        </div>
                        <div style="text-align: center;">
                            <button style="background-color: #ffc107; color: black; padding: 10px 15px; border: none; cursor: pointer;">SCHEDULE APPOINTMENT</button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
        <span>&copy; {{ current_year }} greenphire</span>
        <span>3</span>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <div class="logo-container">
        <div class="clincard-logo">ClinCard</div>
        <div class="powered-by">Powered by <span class="logo-greenphire">greenphire</span></div>
    </div>

    <h2 id="lookup" class="section-header">Look Up a Previously Registered Subject</h2>
    <div class="step-list">
        <li>Login to <a href="{{ login_url }}">www.clincard.com</a>.</li>
        <li>Click the <span data-field="lookup_tab">{{ lookup_tab }}</span> tab.</li>
        <li>Enter one of the following pieces of information:
            <ul style="list-style-type: disc; margin-left: 20px;">
                <li>First name and/or last name</li>
                <li>Subject ID</li>
                <li>Subject's initials</li>
                <li>Subject's email</li>
                <li>Last four (4) digits of ClinCard</li>
            </ul>
        </li>
        <li>Click <span data-field="search_button">{{ search_button }}</span>.</li>
    </div>

    <div class="code-block">
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 30px;">
            <div style="width: 500px;">
                <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 10px;">
                    <div style="font-size: 30px;">Look Up Subject</div>
                </div>
                <div style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 20px;">
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="lookup_field">Search Field</label>
                        <select id="lookup_field">
                            <option value="name">Name</option>
                            <option value="id">Subject ID</option>
                            <option value="initials">Initials</option>
                            <option value="email">Subject Email</option>
                            <option value="card_digits">Last 4 Digits of ClinCard</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="lookup_value">Value</label>
                        <input type="text" id="lookup_value" value="{{ lookup_value_placeholder }}">
                    </div>
                    <div class="button-group" style="text-align: center; margin-top: 20px;">
                        <button style="background-color: #4CAF50; color: white;">SEARCH</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="step-list" style="margin-top: 30px;">
        <li>Results will appear below the "Search Results" header.</li>
        <li>Click the hyperlink <span data-field="last_name_link">{{ last_name_link }}</span> of the Subject.</li>
    </div>

    <div class="table-container">
        <table>
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th>LAST NAME</th>
                    <th>FIRST NAME</th>
                    <th>LAST FOUR</th>
                    <th>LOCATION</th>
                    <th>STUDY</th>
                    <th>ID</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                <tr>
                    <td><span data-field="result_last_name">{{ result_last_name }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="result_first_name">{{ result_first_name }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="result_last_four">{{ result_last_four }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="result_location">{{ result_location }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="result_study">{{ result_study }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="result_id">{{ result_id }}</span></td>
                </tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
        <span>&copy; {{ current_year }} greenphire</span>
        <span>4</span>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <div class="logo-container">
        <div class="clincard-logo">ClinCard</div>
        <div class="powered-by">Powered by <span class="logo-greenphire">greenphire</span></div>
    </div>

    <h2 id="assign" class="section-header">Assign a ClinCard</h2>
    <p>Once you have selected an existing Subject or registered a new Subject, you will be brought to the "Subject Information" screen. On the right-hand side of the screen, you will see options that represent the actions you can perform on the Subject.</p>
    <div class="step-list">
        <li>Click <span data-field="assign_clincard_button">{{ assign_clincard_button }}</span> and a pop-up screen will appear.</li>
        <li>In the "New Card" field, enter the token number visible through the window of the ClinCard card package.
            <ul style="list-style-type: disc; margin-left: 20px;">
                <li>Note: Do not open the envelope prior to providing to the Subject. The token number is different than the 16-digit card number.</li>
            </ul>
        </li>
        <li>Click <span data-field="assign_button">{{ assign_button }}</span>.</li>
    </div>

    <div class="code-block">
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 30px;">
            <div style="width: 600px;">
                <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 10px;">
                    <button style="background-color: #ddd;">SUBJECT INFORMATION</button>
                    <button style="background-color: #ddd;">AUDIT HISTORY</button>
                </div>
                <div style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 20px;">
                    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 30px;">
                        <div>
                            <div class="form-group">
                                <label>Study Name</label>
                                <span data-field="study_name_placeholder">{{ study_name_placeholder }}</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-group">
                                <label>Subject ID</label>
                                <span data-field="subject_id_placeholder">{{ subject_id_placeholder }}</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-group">
                                <label>No card assigned.</label>
                                <span data-field="no_card_assigned_status">{{ no_card_assigned_status }}</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <div class="form-group">
                                <label>Study Status</label>
                                <span data-field="study_status_placeholder">{{ study_status_placeholder }}</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-group">
                                <label>Address</label>
                                <span data-field="address_placeholder">{{ address_placeholder }}</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-group">
                                <label>Timezone</label>
                                <span data-field="timezone_placeholder">{{ timezone_placeholder }}</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-group">
                                <label>Phone</label>
                                <span data-field="phone_placeholder">{{ phone_placeholder }}</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-group">
                                <label>Allow Text Messages</label>
                                <span data-field="allow_sms_placeholder">{{ allow_sms_placeholder }}</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-group">
                                <label>Allow Email</label>
                                <span data-field="allow_email_placeholder">{{ allow_email_placeholder }}</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-around; margin-top: 40px; border-top: 1px solid #eee; padding-top: 20px;">
                        <div style="text-align: center;">
                            <button style="background-color: #ffc107; color: black; padding: 10px 15px; border: none; cursor: pointer;">ASSIGN CLINCARD</button>
                            <p style="font-size: 12px; margin-top: 5px;">REQUEST PAYMENT</p>
                            <p style="font-size: 12px;">REQUEST REIMBURSEMENT</p>
                            <p style="font-size: 12px;">SCHEDULE APPOINTMENT</p>
                        </div>
                        <div style="text-align: center;">
                            <button style="background-color: #ffc107; color: black; padding: 10px 15px; border: none; cursor: pointer;">EDIT SUBJECT</button>
                            <p style="font-size: 12px; margin-top: 5px;">VIEW HISTORY</p>
                        </div>
                        <div style="text-align: center;">
                            <button style="background-color: #ffc107; color: black; padding: 10px 15px; border: none; cursor: pointer;">SCHEDULE APPOINTMENT</button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="code-block" style="margin-top: 30px;">
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 30px;">
            <div style="width: 350px;">
                <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 10px;">
